---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { PromptDemo } from "../components/PromptDemo";
import { ArrowRight, Blocks, Layers2 } from "lucide-react";
---

<Layout title="别只读 AI Coding，亲手让它发生">
  <section class="home-intro">
    <span class="eyebrow">
      <span class="live-dot" /> THE AI CODING PLAYGROUND
    </span>
    <h1>
      别只读 AI Coding。<span>亲手让它发生。</span>
    </h1>
    <p>发出提示词，看代码生长；发现问题，再把作品往前推一步。</p>
  </section>
  <PromptDemo client:load />
  <div class="case-choices">
    <a class="case-choice" href="/case/from-scratch">
      <span class="case-choice-icon">
        <Blocks size={22} />
      </span>
      <div>
        <small>CASE 01 · 从零开始</small>
        <h2>从一句话，到一个网站。</h2>
        <p>提示词 → 代码 → 预览 → 反馈 → 交付</p>
      </div>
      <ArrowRight size={19} />
    </a>
    <a class="case-choice" href="/case/todo-app">
      <span class="case-choice-icon green">
        <Layers2 size={22} />
      </span>
      <div>
        <small>CASE 02 · 已有项目</small>
        <h2>给 Todo 增加一条备注。</h2>
        <p>读项目 → 分层修改 → 验证数据流</p>
      </div>
      <ArrowRight size={19} />
    </a>
  </div>
  <p class="home-footnote">
    无需账号或 API Key，直接体验。
    <a href="/setup">
      想在本地跟做？先准备工具 <ArrowRight size={12} />
    </a>
  </p>
</Layout>
